nd research more accessible.

We would like to start with a focused research pilot on [specific Agent safet=
y question], supported by open learning materials and small research discussi=
ons. Our planned AI-native operating model delegates routine community coordi=
nation, event preparation and progress reporting to Agents within defined aut=
hority limits. People remain responsible for governance, resource allocation,=
 in-person delivery and exceptions.

Would you be willing to review a one-page pilot outline and recommend an eval=
uation method or an openly available benchmark? Our immediate goal is to iden=
